{"id":"n64476-2-8","stage":5,"title":"솟구치다 · 涌上","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64476-2-8-1","ko":"오늘따라 힘이 넘쳐 보이네.","zh":"今天你看起来精力特别充沛啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘따라","meaning":"今天","explanation":"오늘：今天；따라：强调某个时间、场合等与平常不同，如 오늘따라（偏偏今天）。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68207","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘따라","audio":"/audio/63be5b9d45dede0ea5d0.mp3"}},{"text":"힘이","meaning":"力量，力气","explanation":"힘：力量，力气；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"힘","audio":"/audio/68de24edc341fabd21d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28633","senseId":"1","lemma":"힘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘이","audio":"/audio/748f97ff6aa7a31c4ea0.mp3"}},{"text":"넘쳐","meaning":"洋溢，充满","explanation":"넘치다：洋溢，充满；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"넘치다","audio":"/audio/c2c9d694bbc93632e381.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62327","senseId":"3","lemma":"넘치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넘쳐","audio":"/audio/e05c7d1b5d730ee29d3d.mp3"}},{"text":"보이네.","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이네","audio":"/audio/3e5827b860b431fd1899.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68207","definition":"在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"68de24edc341fabd","term":"힘","zh":"力量，力气","audio":"/audio/68de24edc341fabd21d4.mp3","entryId":"28633","definition":"人或动物自己运动或使其他事物移动的肌肉作用。","pronunciation":["힘"]},{"id":"c2c9d694bbc93632","term":"넘치다","zh":"洋溢，充满","audio":"/audio/c2c9d694bbc93632e381.mp3","entryId":"62327","definition":"产生强烈的心思、情感或气息等。","pronunciation":["넘ː치다"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/87d34a7b11a31b2cffa6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64476-2-8-2","ko":"응, 보약을 먹었더니 힘이 마구 솟구쳐 올라.","zh":"嗯，吃了补药之后，力气一下子就变得很足。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"보약을","meaning":"补药","explanation":"보약：补药；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"보약","audio":"/audio/c8b0880ea87e722f034a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59306","senseId":"1","lemma":"보약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보약을","audio":"/audio/30a4e20d86a340860535.mp3"}},{"text":"먹었더니","meaning":"服，吃","explanation":"먹다：服，吃；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"3","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹었더니","audio":"/audio/11f25c19571a122b3706.mp3"}},{"text":"힘이","meaning":"劲儿，效用，作用","explanation":"힘：劲儿，效用，作用；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"힘","audio":"/audio/68de24edc341fabd21d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28633","senseId":"5","lemma":"힘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘이","audio":"/audio/748f97ff6aa7a31c4ea0.mp3"}},{"text":"마구","meaning":"狠狠地，严厉地，尽情地","explanation":"마구：狠狠地，严厉地，尽情地。","readings":[{"term":"마구","audio":"/audio/cd62c24d6a809dcd7d5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51510","senseId":"1","lemma":"마구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마구","audio":"/audio/cd62c24d6a809dcd7d5f.mp3"}},{"text":"솟구쳐","meaning":"涌上，产生","explanation":"솟구치다：涌上，产生；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"솟구치다","audio":"/audio/c0cfea1909c31054caf8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64476","senseId":"2","lemma":"솟구치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"솟구쳐","audio":"/audio/c76a77b709929ac6f09b.mp3"}},{"text":"올라.","meaning":"上涨，振奋，旺盛","explanation":"오르다：上涨，振奋，旺盛；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오르다","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69518","senseId":"11","lemma":"오르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올라","audio":"/audio/3ca724409b9116eb46fd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"c8b0880ea87e722f","term":"보약","zh":"补药","audio":"/audio/c8b0880ea87e722f034a.mp3","entryId":"59306","definition":"增强体内元气、有助于健康的药。","pronunciation":["보ː약"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"服，吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将药物放进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"68de24edc341fabd","term":"힘","zh":"劲儿，效用，作用","audio":"/audio/68de24edc341fabd21d4.mp3","entryId":"28633","definition":"药物等对人体产生影响的效力或效能。","pronunciation":["힘"]},{"id":"cd62c24d6a809dcd","term":"마구","zh":"狠狠地，严厉地，尽情地","audio":"/audio/cd62c24d6a809dcd7d5f.mp3","entryId":"51510","definition":"程度很深地。","pronunciation":["마구"]},{"id":"c0cfea1909c31054","term":"솟구치다","zh":"涌上，产生","audio":"/audio/c0cfea1909c31054caf8.mp3","entryId":"64476","definition":"感情或力量等急速而强烈地冒出来。","pronunciation":["솓꾸치다"]},{"id":"8fdeb9822b3fa061","term":"오르다","zh":"上涨，振奋，旺盛","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3","entryId":"69518","definition":"气势或势力变得更多或更强。","pronunciation":["오르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c0b7b055c2fbc70bfe0b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.58,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=64476","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"h